      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ETHANS REVENGE (4) couldn't match the flying Loucasso last week but had been good from tricky draws in his other two starts this time in, winning from the back row when fresh at Penrith before a close second here. Comes up against an easier bunch this week and should get his chance from this draw. LOCHINVAR MARCELLO (7) was just in front of ETHANS REVENGE when fourth last week. A wide draw makes his task tougher but he has been going well, winning three back at this circuit and distance. AGENTOFGOODINTENT (3) raced parked but was too strong at Penrith last start. Led from wider than this when he won at this circuit and distance in July so can take advantage of the good draw. DUTTON (1) rises in grade but he toughed out a win after working here last start and should get the favours from the inside draw.",
